data: {"id": "7bb8cd1769bb4181-thinking-parallel_evidence-1214", "run_id": "7bb8cd1769bb4181", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 实体确认\n- **Pod `aiops-case-v01/workload`**: UID `6743bbac-5908-452b-a35b-5f6327fe8a58`, 创建时间 `2026-09-11T05:28:07Z`, 处于 **Pending** 阶段, 未分配到任何 Node (`nodeName: <none>`), 未就绪 (`IP: <none>`, `READY: 0/1`)。\n\n### 候选原因 1: PendingUnschedulable (直接原因：Insufficient cpu)\n- **支持事实**:\n    1. **Pod 状态**: `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示 Pod 的 `PodScheduled` 条件为 `status=False`, `reason=Unschedulable`, 且 `nodeName` 为 `<none>`。\n    2. **Kubernetes 事件 (`kubectl_events`, `kubectl_describe`)**: 反复出现 `FailedS", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1789107088463, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

